  "releaseNotes": "0.11.10 Adds addPlayerToGroup commands for Sonos group and player drivers. Resolves identifiers by RINCON ID, name, MAC, IP, or device network ID, validates household and group state, and mutates only the requested membership. Includes coverage for forwarding, resolution, ambiguity, inactive groups, and standalone coordinators.\\r\\n0.11.9 Redesigned the Sonos management UI, made the new interface the default, and improved player discovery and the group editor. Group operations now validate targets and handle eviction without unintended regrouping. Improved favorite loading, playlist playback, WebSocket subscription recovery, and grouped volume updates. Also includes player state, null-safety, and compilation fixes.\\r\\n0.11.8 Redesigned the Sonos management UI, made the new interface the default, and improved player discovery and the group editor. Group operations now validate targets and handle eviction without unintended regrouping. Improved favorite loading, playlist playback, WebSocket subscription recovery, and grouped volume updates. Also includes player state, null-safety, and compilation fixes.",
